</header>
<main class="exhibition" id="portfolio" aria-label="Portfolio exhibition; scroll sideways on desktop" tabindex="0">
  <section class="sheet sheet-light sheet-intro" id="intro" data-name="Introduction">
    <div class="section-rule"><span>FIG. 001 / PERSONAL INTRODUCTION</span><span>2026 — DESIGN & TECHNOLOGY</span></div>
    <div class="intro-kicker"><span class="orange-signal"></span> SOFTWARE MANAGER <span class="separate">//</span> PRODUCT DESIGNER</div>
    <div class="intro-layout">
      <div class="intro-text">
        <h1>Nyan Lin <span>Zaw<span class="period">.</span></span></h1>
        <p>I build human-centered software and thoughtfully engineered experiences that connect technology with real-world needs. My work spans full-stack development, product design, and research, with a focus on creating intuitive, accessible, and meaningful digital experiences.</p>
        <div class="cta-line"><button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" data-contact>Contact info <span>↗</span></button><button class="btn btn-outline" id="resume" type="button">View résumé <span>↗</span></button></div>
        <p id="resume-msg" class="inline-note" hidden>Résumé has not been provided yet. Add its actual file to enable this button.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="intro-art" aria-hidden="true"><span class="bracket left">[</span><img src="assets/arrow.gif" alt=""><span class="bracket right">]</span></div>
    </div>
    <footer class="sheet-footer"><span>01 — ABOUT ME</span><span class="scroll-callout">SCROLL TO EXPLORE <b>⟶</b></span></footer>
  </section>


<section class="sheet sheet-blue sheet-education"
         id="education" data-name="Education & awards">
  <h2>Education <em>& Awards.</em></h2>
  <div class="edu-panels">

    <button class="edu-flip-card" type="button"
