    <span>EDUCATION & AWARDS</span><span>02 / 09</span>
  </footer>
</section>
  <section class="sheet sheet-light sheet-work" id="work" data-name="Current work">
    <div class="section-rule"><span>FIG. 003 / CURRENT WORK EXPERIENCE</span><span>BEREA COLLEGE / SOFTWARE</span></div>
    <h2>Building tools <em>that matter.</em></h2>
    <p class="section-subtitle">Software development, collaboration, and technical leadership for institutional platforms.</p>
    <div class="work-cards">
      <button type="button" class="work-visual" data-detail="labor"><span class="pill-num">01</span><img loading="lazy" src="assets/labor.png" alt="Labor Status Form supervisor portal screenshot"><div class="work-caption"><strong>Labor Status Form</strong><span>WEB APPLICATION ↗</span></div></button>
      <button type="button" class="work-visual" data-detail="celts"><span class="pill-num">02</span><img loading="lazy" src="assets/celts.png" alt="CELTS volunteer program application screenshot"><div class="work-caption"><strong>CELTS Application</strong><span>COMMUNITY SERVICES ↗</span></div></button>
    </div>
    <div class="impact"><div><strong>4</strong><span>WEB APPLICATIONS</span></div><div><strong>2,000+</strong><span>USERS SERVED</span></div><div><strong>14</strong><span>STUDENT DEVELOPERS</span></div><div><strong>35%</strong><span>BACKLOG REDUCTION*</span></div></div>
    <p class="small-note">*Numbers shown in the supplied Figma reference; confirm final metrics before publishing.</p>
    <footer class="sheet-footer"><span>CLICK A SCREEN TO OPEN THE CASE STUDY</span><span>03 / 09</span></footer>
  </section>

  <section class="sheet sheet-blue sheet-experience" id="experience" data-name="Past experience">
    <div class="section-rule"><span>FIG. 004 / EXPERIENCE & COLLABORATION</span><span>DESIGN / RESEARCH / COMMUNITY</span></div>
    <h2>Previous <em>work & experiments.</em></h2>
    <p class="section-subtitle">Select a project to inspect its details. These expand into closable overlays without leaving the exhibition.</p>
    <div class="experience-grid">
      <button class="experience-card" type="button" data-detail="aauw"><span class="exp-no">001 / WEB DESIGN</span><img src="assets/aauw.png" loading="lazy" alt="AAUW Berea website desktop mockup"><div><strong>AAUW</strong><span>VIEW EXPERIENCE ↗</span></div></button>
      <button class="experience-card" type="button" data-detail="nextgen"><span class="exp-no">002 / RESPONSIVE WEB</span><img src="assets/nextgen.png" loading="lazy" alt="NextGen Justice multi-device mockup"><div><strong>NextGen Justice</strong><span>VIEW EXPERIENCE ↗</span></div></button>
      <button class="experience-card" type="button" data-detail="aicollective"><span class="exp-no">003 / COMMUNITY & EVENTS</span><img src="assets/ai.png" loading="lazy" alt="AI Collective design displayed on a monitor"><div><strong>The AI Collective</strong><span>VIEW EXPERIENCE ↗</span></div></button>
      <button class="experience-card" type="button" data-detail="snapchat"><span class="exp-no">004 / AR DESIGN</span><img src="assets/snapchat.jpeg" loading="lazy" alt="Snapchat augmented reality summer connections poster"><div><strong>Snapchat AR</strong><span>VIEW EXPERIENCE ↗</span></div></button>
    </div>
    <footer class="sheet-footer"><span>SELECT TO EXPAND</span><span>04 / 09</span></footer>
  </section>

  <section class="sheet sheet-light sheet-projects" id="projects" data-name="Featured projects">
    <div class="section-rule"><span>FIG. 005 / PRODUCT DESIGN PORTFOLIO</span><span>RESEARCH → PROTOTYPE → IMPACT</span></div>
    <h2>Selected <em>projects.</em></h2>
    <p class="section-subtitle">Project research, design systems, prototypes and outcomes. Each project opens a detailed, closable view.</p>
    <div id="project-gallery" class="project-gallery"></div>
    <footer class="sheet-footer"><span>SELECT A PROJECT FOR ITS STORY</span><span>05 / 09</span></footer>
  </section>

  <section class="sheet sheet-blue sheet-research" id="research" data-name="Research & recognition">
    <div class="section-rule"><span>FIG. 006 / PUBLICATIONS & PRESENTATIONS</span><span>IDEAS / INQUIRY / RECOGNITION</span></div>
    <h2>What I've <em>explored.</em></h2>
    <div class="research-grid">
      <article><span>01 / PRODUCT COMMUNICATION</span><h3>Talks that Build</h3><p>Exploring communication factors for the success of emerging professionals in product teams.</p></article>
      <article><span>02 / CLIENT-SIDE AI</span><h3>Optimization & Pruning</h3><p>Building AI/ML models on the client side in the legal sector.</p></article>
      <article><span>03 / COMMUNICATION RESEARCH</span><h3>Co-Cultural Identities</h3><p>Appalachian college students' health-seeking behaviors.</p></article>
    </div>
    <div class="research-showcase"><img src="assets/mr.png" loading="lazy" alt="MindRoute interface blueprint"><div><span>AWARD-WINNING PROJECT</span><h3>MindRoute</h3><p>Second Prize and  Best Use of AI Award, per supplied Figma materials.</p><button type="button" class="btn btn-outline" data-detail="mindroute">Explore journey ↗</button></div></div>
    <footer class="sheet-footer"><span>PUBLICATIONS / PRESENTATIONS</span><span>06 / 09</span></footer>
  </section>

  <section class="sheet sheet-light sheet-labs" id="labs" data-name="Interactive experiences">
    <div class="section-rule"><span>FIG. 007 / INTERACTIVE PROTOTYPES</span><span>FRONTEND-ONLY EXPERIMENTS</span></div>
    <h2>Immersive <em>experiences.</em></h2>
    <p class="section-subtitle">Not just screenshots. Open a working prototype and interact with the concept directly.</p>
    <div class="lab-cards">
      <article class="lab-card"><div class="lab-media"><img src="assets/trove.png" loading="lazy" alt="Trove interactive artifact blueprint illustration"></div><div class="lab-copy"><span>001 / STORYTELLING OBJECT</span><h3>Trove</h3><p>Every object has a story. Scan a pen, Burmese stamp, or rocket keychain.</p><button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" data-detail="trove" data-demo-first="true">Immerse in experience ↗</button></div></article>
      <article class="lab-card"><div class="lab-media"><img src="assets/nand.png" loading="lazy" alt="NAND logic breadboard blueprint illustration"></div><div class="lab-copy"><span>002 / COMPUTER ORGANIZATION</span><h3>NAND Lab</h3><p>Build an AND gate using two NAND gates, connect pins, then test it.</p><button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" data-detail="nand" data-demo-first="true">Immerse in experience ↗</button></div></article>
    </div>
    <footer class="sheet-footer"><span>SIMULATED · INTERACTIVE · NO BACKEND</span><span>07 / 09</span></footer>
  </section>

  <section class="sheet sheet-blue sheet-bacnet" id="bacnet" data-name="BACnet prototyping">
    <div class="section-rule"><span>FIG. 008 / SYSTEMS ENGINEERING</span><span>BUILDING AUTOMATION PROTOCOL</span></div>
    <div class="bacnet-top"><div><span class="overline">INTERACTIVE / FRONTEND SIMULATION</span><h2>BACnet <em>Lab.</em></h2><p>Make devices speak BACnet. Explore simulated discovery, standardized objects, and read/write property operations.</p></div><div class="bacnet-illustration" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 380 210"><g fill="none" stroke="#cce7ff" stroke-width="2"><rect x="15" y="76" width="100" height="58" rx="5"/><rect x="249" y="10" width="112" height="54" rx="5"/><rect x="249" y="147" width="112" height="54" rx="5"/><path d="M115 105H185V37H249M185 105V174H249" stroke="#ff791e" stroke-width="4"/><circle cx="185" cy="105" r="7" fill="#ff791e" stroke="#ff791e"/></g><g font-size="11" fill="#f4f8ff" font-family="monospace"><text x="38" y="110">BMS</text><text x="272" y="40">HVAC</text><text x="268" y="178">LIGHTING</text></g></svg></div></div>
    <div class="bacnet-bottom"><button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" data-detail="bacnet" data-demo-first="true">Immerse in experience ↗</button><button type="button" class="btn btn-outline" data-detail="observatory">BACnet Observatory / details ↗</button></div>
    <div class="bacnet-notice">THE LIVE BACnet/IP SERVER IS NOT INCLUDED. THIS DEMO USES LOCAL, SIMULATED DEVICES AND MESSAGES ONLY.</div>
    <footer class="sheet-footer"><span>PROTOCOLED INTERACTION / FRONTEND</span><span>08 / 09</span></footer>
  </section>

  <section class="sheet sheet-light sheet-contact" id="contact" data-name="Contact">
    <div class="section-rule"><span>FIG. 009 / END OF EXHIBITION</span><span>READY FOR THE NEXT CHAPTER</span></div>
    <div class="end-copy"><span class="overline">DESIGN × ENGINEERING × HUMAN EXPERIENCE</span><h2>Thank you<br><em>for visiting.</em></h2><p>Thoughtful software begins with curiosity. Let's explore what meaningful technology can do next.</p><div class="cta-line"><button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" data-contact>Contact info ↗</button><button type="button" class="btn btn-outline" data-to="intro">← Back to beginning</button></div></div>
    <img src="assets/arrow.gif" class="end-arrow" alt="" aria-hidden="true">
    <footer class="sheet-footer"><span>NYAN LIN ZAW / 2026</span><span>END OF EXHIBITION — 09 / 09</span></footer>
  </section>
