<dialog id="detail-dialog" class="detail-dialog" aria-labelledby="detail-title">
  <div class="dialog-shell"><header class="dialog-header"><div><span class="dialog-index" id="detail-label">PROJECT / CASE STUDY</span><h2 id="detail-title">Project details</h2></div><button type="button" id="detail-close" class="dialog-close" aria-label="Close project details">CLOSE <span>×</span></button></header>
  <div class="dialog-content" id="detail-content"></div></div>
</dialog>
<dialog id="contact-dialog" class="contact-dialog" aria-labelledby="contact-title"><div class="dialog-shell"><header class="dialog-header"><div><span class="dialog-index">GET IN TOUCH / CONTACT DETAILS</span><h2 id="contact-title">Contact info</h2></div><button type="button" id="contact-close" class="dialog-close" aria-label="Close contact info">CLOSE <span>×</span></button></header><div class="contact-body"><p>My contact links and résumé have not been supplied. This panel is ready to connect to actual destinations without inventing emails or profiles.</p><div class="contact-links"><button disabled type="button">Email / not configured</button><button disabled type="button">LinkedIn / not configured</button><button disabled type="button">GitHub / not configured</button></div><p class="small-note">Edit the contact configuration in <code>app.js</code> to enable verified links.</p></div></div></dialog>
